# --- Supply-chain artefacts (emitted by the gate, never committed) ---
# SBOMs, signatures, and attestations are release outputs. [NFR-PQ-3] [NFR-OSS-1]
*.sbom.cdx.json
*.sig
*.att
/artefacts
# mg-repro's per-artefact reproducibility report; CI uploads it, mg-sign embeds
# it into the provenance attestation. Regenerated by `just repro`. [AC-M-6]
/repro.json
# Signing keystores and exported trust anchors are custody material, never
# committed — `just keygen` writes them into the working directory by default.
*.keystore
*.pub

# --- Secrets: never in the repo. Keys are issued at runtime by KMS/HSM. ---
# [STD:OWASP ASVS V14.3]
*.pem
*.key
.env
.env.*

# --- Editor / OS ---
.DS_Store
.idea
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json

